top.en:
Does it feel like BLG is playing a huge game of chess?
First, they predicted the future during the domestic matches, knowing AL's Worlds top 16 performance would look too ugly, so they handed them a domestic title first;
Then, in the Swiss stage, they protected their brothers, personally carrying TES into the top 8 while purposely going 2-2 to ambush HLE;
In the knockout stage, BLG first kicks aside DK, then captures T1;
Meanwhile, TES first defeats IG, then takes down GEN;
Finally, BLG and TES meet in the finals, where TES returns BLG's Swiss stage victory, and Knight takes FMVP to achieve the true title of China's greatest mid laner in history.
Thus, the Faker era comes to an end, and the Big Hand era begins.
